# Text Classification on IMDB Reviews

This project builds a text classification pipeline on the IMDB 50K movie reviews dataset. It covers text preprocessing, feature engineering, and similarity techniques using Python, pandas, NLTK, and scikit-learn [web:149][web:151].

## Project Steps
- Text cleaning
- Tokenization
- Stemming and lemmatization
- Stopword removal
- Regex-based preprocessing
- Bag of Words
- TF-IDF
- N-grams
- Word embeddings
- Cosine similarity
- Jaccard similarity
- Edit distance

## Dataset
The project uses the IMDB 50K Movie Reviews dataset with review text and sentiment labels [web:91].

## Tools
- Python
- Pandas
- NLTK
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib
- Gensim

## Goal
The goal is to learn how raw text is transformed into useful numerical features for text classification and NLP tasks [web:144][web:149].
